items.description:
GTA VI will target 30FPS across PlayStation and Xbox consoles, with Rockstar
using its own temporal anti-aliasing solution on the PS5 and Xbox Series X,
Sony's PSSR 2 on the PS5 Pro, and AMD's FSR 4 on the Xbox Series S.

